{% extends 'policy.njk' %}
{% block policy_body %}
<h2>Order Processing</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Orders are processed within <strong>15–20 business days</strong>, excluding Sundays and public holidays.</li>
  <li>A confirmation email and/or SMS with tracking information will be shared once your order is shipped.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Estimated Delivery Timelines</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Standard Delivery:</strong> 3–7 business days (based on your delivery location).</li>
  <li><strong>Express Delivery:</strong> 1–3 business days (available in select metro cities at an additional charge).</li>
</ul>

<h2>Shipping Time</h2>
<p>After processing, your order will be shipped within 15–20 business days. All the products will be delivered within 5–7 business days from dispatch.</p>

<h2>Returns Policy</h2>
<p>We understand that sometimes a product may not meet your expectations. Please review our returns policy below.</p>

<h3>Return Window</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Return requests must be raised within <strong>15 days of product delivery</strong>.</li>
</ul>

<h3>Return Eligibility</h3>
<ul>
  <li>Items must be unused, unopened, and in their original condition with all packaging intact.</li>
</ul>

<h3>How to Initiate a Return</h3>
<ol>
  <li><strong>Contact Customer Support:</strong> Email us at <a href="mailto:enquiries@xeviadiamonds.com">enquiries@xeviadiamonds.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+919203326281">+91 92033 26281</a>. Share your order or enquiry reference number and the reason for the return.</li>
  <li><strong>Return Authorization:</strong> Once reviewed and approved, you will receive a Return Authorization (RA) number and detailed return instructions.</li>
  <li><strong>Packaging &amp; Return:</strong> Securely pack the product(s) and clearly label the RA number on the parcel.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Inspection &amp; Resolution</h2>
<p>All returned items undergo a quality inspection upon receipt. If eligible, your refund or replacement will be processed as per our <a href="/refund-policy">Refund Policy</a>.</p>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Return Pickup:</strong> Scheduled within 2–4 business days (depending on location).</li>
  <li><strong>Replacement Dispatch:</strong> Processed within 15–20 business days after successful inspection. Delivery in 7–10 business days.</li>
</ul>
<p>Returns may be rejected if the item is found to be used, damaged, or not meeting the return criteria.</p>
{% endblock %}
